WEBVTT

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:44.040
Yes! Ming-Ming's up first!

00:01:44.040 --> 00:01:46.840
You can do it, Ming-Ming!

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:53.420
--Ming-Ming! Ming-Ming!

00:01:53.420 --> 00:01:59.930
Hi! Ming-Ming's gonna
battle her bestest!

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.620
Be careful.

00:02:07.140 --> 00:02:11.190
Despite his looks, he's a
part of the champion's team.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:14.940
He might be one of the
strongest in the world.

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:22.240
I'll prove to him that I'm a great Blader despite my lovely looks!

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:30.330
Thanks for waiting! The arena for
the first match of the Justice 5 will be...

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:32.970
This stadium!

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:46.370
The Aphrodite Stadium!

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:54.650
Who will grasp glory for themselves in
this stadium of courage and justice?!

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:59.050
Hitoshi...

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:00.700
Kyoujyu!
What do you think?

00:03:01.730 --> 00:03:07.450
Oh, right. I don't detect any
sort of traps in this stadium.

00:03:07.450 --> 00:03:13.740
With so many people watching,
I don't think they'll try anything funny.

00:03:15.210 --> 00:03:19.460
I just gotta take
a win offa that girl!

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:22.080
Don't drop your guard, Daichi!

00:03:22.080 --> 00:03:25.210
She's one of
Volkov's chosen Bladers.

00:03:25.210 --> 00:03:28.920
We don't know what kind
of tricks they'll pull!

00:03:28.920 --> 00:03:31.520
That would never happen!

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:33.740
W-what?

00:03:33.740 --> 00:03:38.770
Ming-Ming would never cheat!

00:03:40.040 --> 00:03:45.090
Ming-Ming
has a pure heart!

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:48.740
So I know she'd never cheat!

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:50.500
Kyoujyu...

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:56.130
What makes you think she's
got such a pure heart?

00:03:56.130 --> 00:03:59.220
There's no mistaking it!
After all...

00:03:59.220 --> 00:04:07.520
The third song on her newest album is
"My Pure Heart Goes Round and Round!"

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:11.010
Oh my God...

00:04:11.010 --> 00:04:13.320
So what?

00:04:13.320 --> 00:04:16.840
That's why
her heart is pure!

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:19.010
Well, I mean...

00:04:19.010 --> 00:04:24.690
You may be right, but Volkov
might be planning something.

00:04:24.690 --> 00:04:29.260
Yeah!
Rei's right, Kyoujyu!

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:33.700
Right.
That's a possibility...

00:04:33.700 --> 00:04:37.020
Anyway, this match is important.

00:04:37.020 --> 00:04:39.920
We'll be able to get a
feel for their strategies.

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:45.200
We can see how strong
BEGA's Bladers are too.

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.760
Be sure to analyze
her data, Kyoujyu!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.940
I can handle it!

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:56.970
Ming-Ming will be
recorded on my laptop!

00:04:58.640 --> 00:05:00.180
Is he gonna be okay?

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:01.600
Honestly...

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:07.460
Time to start the first
match of the Justice 5!

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.120
Here we go...

00:05:16.120 --> 00:05:19.800
This'll decide the
future of Beyblading...

00:05:19.800 --> 00:05:25.400
Here comes the BEGA
Blader, Ming-Ming!

00:05:29.260 --> 00:05:31.370
Ming-Ming's so cute!

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:43.070
It's like she doesn't even care. Does she
know how important this match is?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:48.490
Her opponent will be Daichi Sumeragi,
winner of the tag-battle world championships!

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.120
Y'all can shut
the hell up!

00:05:54.120 --> 00:05:57.770
Reborn into the
Heavy Metal System!

00:05:57.770 --> 00:06:03.160
My Gaia Dragoon Metal Spike
is gonna leave you speechless!

00:06:08.890 --> 00:06:12.120
Those are their new Beys?

00:06:12.120 --> 00:06:15.060
Not bad for
being hand-made.

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:20.250
Let's see if
they're any good.

00:06:25.530 --> 00:06:31.860
Daichi's Bey seems to
be hand-made by Kyoujyu!

00:06:31.860 --> 00:06:37.410
Let's see how it'll fare
against Ming-Ming's Venus!

00:06:38.580 --> 00:06:42.300
Each Blader is coming at
today's first match ready to win!

00:06:42.300 --> 00:06:49.330
Will Daichi's power win out? What kind
of lovely moves will Ming-Ming use?!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:53.490
Their first battle
is about to begin!

00:07:08.050 --> 00:07:11.180
Be careful, Daichi.

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:16.290
Let me see
your new power!

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:22.280
Counting on you,
Gaia Dragoon!

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:38.880
All right! Bring it on!

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:43.170
Don't look so scary!
Smile, smile!

00:07:43.170 --> 00:07:47.730
Shut up! The future of
Beyblading is riding on this!

00:07:47.730 --> 00:07:50.450
I can't smile!

00:07:50.450 --> 00:07:52.940
Whoopsie!
He got mad...

00:07:53.380 --> 00:07:55.720
But that's actually good!

00:07:55.720 --> 00:07:59.890
I need you to fight
with all you've got!

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:04.560
To prove just how
strong Venus and I are!

00:08:06.570 --> 00:08:08.140
Here I go!

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:30.160
Bang!

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:35.200
Here we go!

00:08:35.200 --> 00:08:39.420
Ready?
Three! Two! One!

00:08:39.610 --> 00:08:41.440
Go, Shoot!

00:08:45.890 --> 00:08:49.000
Uh-oh! Can't even
control your shot?

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:54.040
Shut up! Give her a taste of what
you're made of, Gaia Dragoon!

00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.120
Fast!

00:08:59.120 --> 00:09:02.380
I told him to be careful!

00:09:02.380 --> 00:09:04.690
He went in full throttle!

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:06.570
But he'll be okay.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:12.250
Nothing can stand up to the power of
Gaia Dragoon in the Heavy Metal System.

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:16.690
I'm not gonna do something
boring like wait for you to attack.

00:09:16.690 --> 00:09:22.620
None of your dirty tricks can stand
up to the power of Gaia Dragoon!

00:09:22.900 --> 00:09:26.180
Knock her out, Gaia Dragoon!

00:09:30.280 --> 00:09:31.530
What?!

00:09:34.930 --> 00:09:37.770
You're really strong.

00:09:37.770 --> 00:09:42.970
But you'll need more than
that to beat my Venus!

00:09:45.730 --> 00:09:50.290
No way! She stood up
to Gaia Dragoon's power?!

00:09:50.290 --> 00:09:51.760
Rick!

00:09:52.720 --> 00:09:56.570
BEGA's Bladers
aren't just for show.

00:09:59.770 --> 00:10:02.790
Darn... I can't
push through!

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:14.700
She's way stronger
than she looks!

00:10:20.410 --> 00:10:25.330
That rotation, the speed,
and sheer force...

00:10:25.680 --> 00:10:31.250
It may be even more advanced than the Beys developed by our BEGA staff.

00:10:32.900 --> 00:10:38.180
Takao Kinomiya and the lot of them
are exceptionally talented Bladers.

00:10:38.520 --> 00:10:44.520
But that boy is even more
talented as an engineer!

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.360
He's a force to
be reckoned with...

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:55.690
We shouldn't have only been
cautious about Takao Kinomiya.

00:10:55.690 --> 00:10:58.080
But perhaps
this boy as well!

00:10:59.930 --> 00:11:02.420
You can do it, Daichi.

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:05.360
But don't be too
rough on Ming-Ming.

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:08.480
But we have to win...

00:11:09.240 --> 00:11:13.200
But I can't bear to
see Ming-Ming lose!

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.570
What do I do?!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.980
Good grief...

00:11:20.110 --> 00:11:22.990
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:25.280 --> 00:11:27.950
"Bakuten Shoot Beyblade G-Revolution"

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.610
Go, Gaia Dragoon!

00:11:30.610 --> 00:11:32.960
Take him down, Venus!

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.980
Dangit!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:45.730
What's the matter?
Keep attacking.

00:11:45.730 --> 00:11:50.160
You won't be able to
pluck a single petal...

00:11:51.060 --> 00:11:52.920
Off of my flower!

00:11:56.820 --> 00:12:02.400
Darn her! I didn't think
she'd be this powerful...

00:12:02.770 --> 00:12:04.280
Gaia Dragoon!

00:12:05.740 --> 00:12:08.500
Hey! Singer lady!

00:12:08.500 --> 00:12:11.410
Singer lady?!

00:12:11.760 --> 00:12:15.200
Just so we're
clear, I'm pissed!

00:12:15.200 --> 00:12:16.500
What?

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:20.940
At Volkov's cheap tactics and you, for being such an amazing Blader!

00:12:20.940 --> 00:12:24.890
For Beyblading with all
that flashy bullcrap!

00:12:25.880 --> 00:12:29.360
I hate people who
don't battle seriously!

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:33.360
People like that can get
the hell outta my stadium!

00:12:33.360 --> 00:12:34.810
Venus!

00:12:35.820 --> 00:12:40.300
No! I'll make 'em leave!

00:12:45.760 --> 00:12:47.820
You're finished!

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:50.180
What?!

00:12:50.820 --> 00:12:52.810
I think you're mistaken.

00:12:52.810 --> 00:12:54.820
Mistaken?!

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.610
This is how I really play!

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:05.290
I'm serious when it comes
to Beyblade and singing!

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.680
I won't hear
complaints from anyone!

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:11.100
Get real!

00:13:28.170 --> 00:13:32.700
I'll prove to you that
I'm playing seriously!

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.060
What?!

00:13:37.010 --> 00:13:41.680
I play and sing seriously.
For myself.

00:13:41.680 --> 00:13:44.420
I do it out of love!

00:13:57.940 --> 00:13:59.650
Transform!

00:13:59.650 --> 00:14:01.690
What?!

00:14:05.040 --> 00:14:07.080
Are you ready?

00:14:08.240 --> 00:14:09.880
Are you ready?!

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.660
Are you ready?

00:14:14.730 --> 00:14:16.460
I am!

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.610
Who are you
cheering for?!

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:26.000
A concert...

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.090
What the heck?

00:14:28.460 --> 00:14:32.560
Oh, shut up!
What about this is serious?!

00:14:41.330 --> 00:14:44.610
She's moving faster now!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:52.020
Dangit!

00:15:09.330 --> 00:15:11.980
She's finally gotten serious.

00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:15.740
This is her true battle style!

00:15:15.740 --> 00:15:20.320
No one will be able to
keep up with her now!

00:15:28.700 --> 00:15:34.440
This is real bad...
I'm losing control of Gaia Dragoon!

00:15:35.020 --> 00:15:37.760
One more!

00:15:47.050 --> 00:15:50.920
Singing in the middle battle?!
She's making fun of us!

00:15:50.920 --> 00:15:52.850
Those eyes...

00:15:55.280 --> 00:15:58.310
Her eyes during
her performances...

00:15:59.240 --> 00:16:04.160
There's no sense of
hesitation or nervousness...

00:16:04.700 --> 00:16:10.960
Those eyes are what puts
her above any other idol!

00:16:10.960 --> 00:16:14.800
Kyoujyu!
This isn't the time!

00:16:14.800 --> 00:16:21.680
No! She's focused the
most when she's singing.

00:16:21.680 --> 00:16:25.170
And I'm certain that concentration
is poured into her Beyblade!

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.420
What?!

00:16:27.010 --> 00:16:30.880
So she isn't singing
to confuse Daichi...

00:16:30.880 --> 00:16:33.780
But to improve herself?

00:16:33.780 --> 00:16:35.160
I assume so.

00:16:37.500 --> 00:16:39.010
Daichi!!

00:16:41.540 --> 00:16:47.970
Don't let the song distract you!
It's to maximize her own concentration!

00:16:47.970 --> 00:16:49.660
What?!

00:16:49.660 --> 00:16:54.320
So the song is proof that
she's gotten serious?!

00:17:03.330 --> 00:17:10.330
I like it! Beyblade is about hitting
each other with all your might!

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:17.570
We don't need anything else.
So I'll show you everything I've got!

00:17:17.570 --> 00:17:21.480
If you sing, I'll yell!
I'll scream!

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:26.570
Listen to this! The explosive roar
of Gaia Dragoon is my song!

00:17:26.570 --> 00:17:28.840
It's the shout of my soul!

00:17:40.930 --> 00:17:44.570
Howl! Roar! Gaia Dragoon!

00:17:51.900 --> 00:17:56.060
Listen to our roar!

00:18:08.700 --> 00:18:12.570
Gaia Dragoon!
Spike Saw!!

00:18:17.410 --> 00:18:21.100
V-Temptation!

00:18:27.280 --> 00:18:28.610
What?!

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.560
Gaia Dragoon...

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.440
We have a winner!

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:55.370
After a hard fought battle,
Ming-Ming is the winner!

00:18:55.370 --> 00:18:58.260
BEGA takes the first win!

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:05.000
Darn it! Darn it! Darn it!

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.760
I... Won?!

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:11.620
Owwie!

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:18.780
My fans...

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:22.450
Our first win.

00:19:23.340 --> 00:19:24.980
Sorry.

00:19:25.860 --> 00:19:28.640
You were playing for real.

00:19:28.640 --> 00:19:33.130
I thought you were just
some fancy pants pop singer.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:40.560
You're a great Blader.
Let's battle again sometime!

00:19:40.560 --> 00:19:43.370
I won't lose next time!

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:59.090
Sorry, guys! I lost.
The first battle, too...

00:19:59.280 --> 00:20:00.780
Daichi...

00:20:00.780 --> 00:20:04.820
But it's not like that
battle went to waste.

00:20:04.820 --> 00:20:08.730
Thanks to Daichi, we have
an idea of how BEGA fights.

00:20:08.730 --> 00:20:13.130
Yeah! They're gonna fight
us fair and square!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:15.260
Yeah. No tricks.

00:20:15.260 --> 00:20:21.170
They'll challenge us with all
their strength and techniques.

00:20:21.400 --> 00:20:24.260
The hardest opponents
of all to fight!

00:20:24.720 --> 00:20:28.940
We just have to hit
'em back head-on!

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.360
You're exactly right!

00:20:31.520 --> 00:20:36.320
We lost the first match,
but let's keep up the momentum!

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:38.890
Countin' on ya!
Rei! Sensei!

00:20:39.080 --> 00:20:41.250
To protect Beyblading.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:43.060
We can't lose!

00:20:43.060 --> 00:20:45.000
Takao Kinomiya!

00:20:45.560 --> 00:20:48.340
Us BEGA Bladers
won't run or hide!

00:20:48.340 --> 00:20:51.740
I hope you'll stay
vigilant in your battles!

00:20:51.740 --> 00:20:55.320
Yeah! If you are,
then so will we!

00:20:55.320 --> 00:21:00.020
We're gonna fight our best battles
with everything we've got!

00:21:00.020 --> 00:21:02.250
Better be ready!

00:21:07.520 --> 00:21:09.240
Daichi!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:10.680
What is it?

00:21:11.940 --> 00:21:16.130
You shook Ming-Ming's hand!

00:21:17.800 --> 00:21:19.480
Lemme go!

00:21:22.200 --> 00:21:26.500
It's not fair! You got to
shake Ming-Ming's hand!

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:27.360
Lemme go!

00:21:27.360 --> 00:21:29.170
Ming-Ming!

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:58.130
Okay! I'm up next!

00:22:58.130 --> 00:23:01.820
I have to win! For Monica!
Let's go! Let's go! Let's go!

00:23:01.820 --> 00:23:05.050
Moses, I understand your
love for your sister.

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:11.660
But as a member of the G-Revolutions and
the White Tiger Clan, I can't back down!

00:23:11.660 --> 00:23:13.060
This is one match I...

00:23:13.060 --> 00:23:14.970
Monica, as your brother I...

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:16.730
--Refuse to lose!!

00:23:16.730 --> 00:23:19.970
I can't cry!
Not until I win!
